  "problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=sec\u2061x?$\n\n- The range of the function is $y=(-\\infty ,-1]$\n- $y=-\\frac{1}{2}$ is an output of the function\n- $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ is not a zero of the function",
